{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And she told her father</b> — this is the language of Rashi (Rashi on Genesis 29:12): her mother had died. And so in Bereshit Rabbah (70:13). According to the plain sense, she told him to inform him of the arrival of her relative and that he should go out to him and honor him, for what does her mother matter to her and what could she do for him? But Rebekah had shown her mother the ornaments that they had given her, according to the custom of young women."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:36:37.325675522Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}